      "message": "I\u0027m not sure this is correct. NPCX platforms set `CONFIG_RO_STORAGE_OFF` to a [non-zero](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/shim/chip/npcx/include/flash_chip.h;l\u003d28;drc\u003df7760c1b03557cfc0e1c6b0f9e7c3a8ef3b9f9b1) value.\n\nDo you have a CL that shows the flash configuration for this new part?",
